    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to the Coven</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your path among powerful Sages, each sworn to a unique Coven Allegiance. Master an arsenal of spectacular spells across three disciplines:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Offensive magics to devastate your foes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defensive enchantments to protect your allies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Support incantations to turn the tide of battle</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205020/extras/e74475921f1383c7a16643da3b34f416.avif?t=1755461570\" data-has-big width=800 height=444 /></span><strong>Dynamic Team Combat</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rally your fellow spellcasters in intense 3v3, 1v1, and 8-player Free-For-All\u00a0battles across whimsical, ever-changing Realms. Work together to claim powerful Relics while outmaneuvering rival teams through tactical spell combinations and coordinated assaults. Victory demands both individual skill and seamless team coordination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205020/extras/3574b09bc7ccdbae1fed65cc7d44691f.poster.avif?t=1755461570\" width=360 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205020/extras/3574b09bc7ccdbae1fed65cc7d44691f.webm?t=1755461570\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205020/extras/3574b09bc7ccdbae1fed65cc7d44691f.mp4?t=1755461570\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic Depth</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diverse roster of Sages, each with unique spell loadouts and playstyles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complex interplay between different Coven Allegiances</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple viable team compositions and strategies</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast-Paced Action</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quick, action-packed matches perfect for both casual and competitive play</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fluid spell-casting system that rewards skill and timing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic objectives that keep every match fresh and exciting</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Magical Progression</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tackle Realm Challenges to gain XP and strengthen you're Sage's abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exit Victorious in Realm Battles to unlock the full power of your Sage</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb the competitive ranks and prove your magical prowess</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205020/extras/dbcb3cec4b9a77f072603d34537950c4.poster.avif?t=1755461570\" width=360 height=198 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205020/extras/dbcb3cec4b9a77f072603d34537950c4.webm?t=1755461570\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205020/extras/dbcb3cec4b9a77f072603d34537950c4.mp4?t=1755461570\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Battlefield Awaits</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump into matches solo or gather your friends to form the ultimate magical strike team. With easy-to-learn but difficult-to-master gameplay, Coven: All Powerful offers an enchanting competitive experience that will keep you coming back for &quot;just one more match.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205020/extras/c57b4f68d5cb47c064cce435822b02fd.poster.avif?t=1755461570\" width=360 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205020/extras/c57b4f68d5cb47c064cce435822b02fd.webm?t=1755461570\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205020/extras/c57b4f68d5cb47c064cce435822b02fd.mp4?t=1755461570\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're a seasoned spellslinger or new to the Realms, there's a place for you in the Coven. Choose your Sage, master your spells, and prepare for magical mayhem!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to the Coven</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your path among powerful Sages, each sworn to a unique Coven Allegiance. Master an arsenal of spectacular spells across three disciplines:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Offensive magics to devastate your foes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defensive enchantments to protect your allies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Support incantations to turn the tide of battle</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205020/extras/e74475921f1383c7a16643da3b34f416.avif?t=1755461570\" data-has-big width=800 height=444 /></span><strong>Dynamic Team Combat</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rally your fellow spellcasters in intense 3v3, 1v1, and 8-player Free-For-All\u00a0battles across whimsical, ever-changing Realms. Work together to claim powerful Relics while outmaneuvering rival teams through tactical spell combinations and coordinated assaults. Victory demands both individual skill and seamless team coordination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205020/extras/3574b09bc7ccdbae1fed65cc7d44691f.poster.avif?t=1755461570\" width=360 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205020/extras/3574b09bc7ccdbae1fed65cc7d44691f.webm?t=1755461570\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205020/extras/3574b09bc7ccdbae1fed65cc7d44691f.mp4?t=1755461570\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic Depth</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diverse roster of Sages, each with unique spell loadouts and playstyles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complex interplay between different Coven Allegiances</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple viable team compositions and strategies</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast-Paced Action</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quick, action-packed matches perfect for both casual and competitive play</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fluid spell-casting system that rewards skill and timing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic objectives that keep every match fresh and exciting</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Magical Progression</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tackle Realm Challenges to gain XP and strengthen you're Sage's abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exit Victorious in Realm Battles to unlock the full power of your Sage</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb the competitive ranks and prove your magical prowess</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205020/extras/dbcb3cec4b9a77f072603d34537950c4.poster.avif?t=1755461570\" width=360 height=198 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205020/extras/dbcb3cec4b9a77f072603d34537950c4.webm?t=1755461570\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205020/extras/dbcb3cec4b9a77f072603d34537950c4.mp4?t=1755461570\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Battlefield Awaits</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump into matches solo or gather your friends to form the ultimate magical strike team. With easy-to-learn but difficult-to-master gameplay, Coven: All Powerful offers an enchanting competitive experience that will keep you coming back for &quot;just one more match.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205020/extras/c57b4f68d5cb47c064cce435822b02fd.poster.avif?t=1755461570\" width=360 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205020/extras/c57b4f68d5cb47c064cce435822b02fd.webm?t=1755461570\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205020/extras/c57b4f68d5cb47c064cce435822b02fd.mp4?t=1755461570\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're a seasoned spellslinger or new to the Realms, there's a place for you in the Coven. Choose your Sage, master your spells, and prepare for magical mayhem!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
